    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_9",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Flowers in the Attic is a 2014 Lifetime movie, starring Kiernan Shipka, Ellen Burstyn, Mason Dye, and Heather Graham. It is the second adaptation of the 1979 novel of the same name by V. C. Andrews. A sequel, \"Petals on the Wind\", based on the novel of the same name, premiered on May 26, 2014, on Lifetime. The network announced the developing of the following books in the series, \"If There Be Thorns\" and \"Seeds of Yesterday\", which both aired in 2015.",
      "depth": 0,
      "parent_id": null,
